  "_comment": "A broom shop: any villager with the broommaker profession (job site: a broom rack) keeps it. Sneak-use opens the board. The shop sells and services; it buys nothing, because every broom is crafted from cheap stock and a shop that bought them back would be a mint. Brooms are priced well above their craft cost - what the shop sells is a broom now, without the materials (a Firebolt needs a Golden Snidget feather to make). The racing brooms are tier-gated and limited to one a week each. Services: broom_servicing (moved here from Ollivanders' workshop), time_trial (a hoop course in the sky round the counter, travel.trial), courier_dispatch (travel.courier). Fittings (broom.fitting) are sold here and handed out as rank rewards; the shop buys none back. Standing is earned by trading here and by twig and polish orders. Broom Flight module: no brooms, no broom shop.",
